1
00:00:00,736 --> 00:00:03,506
(Sheldon:)Amy, please. I am trying
to figure out a way

2
00:00:03,505 --> 00:00:07,475
(Sheldon:)to intellectually emasculate
a dear friend of mine.

3
00:00:07,476 --> 00:00:09,806
(Amy:)But I'm just...
Not now.

4
00:00:09,811 --> 00:00:11,481
(Amy:)You better watch
that attitude, buddy.

5
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:14,480
(Amy:)You're dating the
popular girl now.

6
00:00:17,619 --> 00:00:19,489
(Leonard:)Hmm. You're up late.

7
00:00:19,488 --> 00:00:22,158
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm working on
my lesson plan for Wolowitz.

8
00:00:22,157 --> 00:00:23,927
(Sheldon:)He is going to be so lost.

9
00:00:25,127 --> 00:00:27,127
(Sheldon:)Look at this section over here.

10
00:00:27,129 --> 00:00:30,399
(Sheldon:)Even I don't really
understand it.

11
00:00:30,399 --> 00:00:33,329
(Leonard:)Sheldon, why are you doing this?

12
00:00:33,335 --> 00:00:35,065
(Sheldon:)I'm a teacher, Leonard.

13
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:36,440
(Sheldon:)It's my job.

14
00:00:36,438 --> 00:00:38,438
No, I-I mean,

15
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,210
(Leonard:)why are you going
to so much trouble

16
00:00:40,209 --> 00:00:41,939
(Leonard:)to prove that you're smarter
than Wolowitz?

17
00:00:41,944 --> 00:00:44,974
Oh, it's no trouble;
it's actually a pleasure.

18
00:00:46,014 --> 00:00:48,214
(Leonard:)You want to know what I think?

19
00:00:48,217 --> 00:00:51,247
(Leonard:)I think the idea that someone
could be as smart as you,

20
00:00:51,253 --> 00:00:53,783
(Leonard:)or even smarter,
scares the pants off you,

21
00:00:53,789 --> 00:00:55,359
(Leonard:)and you can't deal with it.

22
00:00:57,326 --> 00:00:59,156
(Sheldon:)Interesting point.

